{"css": "\nbody{margin:0;background:#F6F4F0;font-family:'Archivo',system-ui,sans-serif;color:#1A1918}\na{color:#1A1918}a:hover{color:#6B6660}\n.cap{font-size:12px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:0.18em;text-transform:uppercase}\n.wrap{max-width:1440px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 64px;box-sizing:border-box}\n.slot{background:#E3DED6;color:#6B6660;display:flex;align-items:flex-end;padding:16px;box-sizing:border-box;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5}\n.tbl{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:16px}\n.tbl th,.tbl td{text-align:left;padding:14px 16px 14px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #DCD6CD;vertical-align:top}\n.tbl th{font-weight:400;color:#6B6660}\n@media (max-width:760px){.wrap{padding:0 20px}}\n.ph{display:block;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover}\n", "body": "\n\n\n\n\n\n<div style=\"font-family: 'Archivo', system-ui, sans-serif; color: #1A1918; background: #F6F4F0; min-height: 100vh\">\n\n  <div style=\"background: #EDE9E3; border-bottom: 1px solid #DCD6CD\">\n    <div class=\"wrap\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px 32px; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; min-height: 44px\">\n      <nav aria-label=\"MIRAKLE worlds\" style=\"display: flex; gap: 28px; flex-wrap: wrap\">\n        <a class=\"cap\" href=\"/architectural/\" aria-current=\"page\" style=\"text-decoration: none; padding: 12px 0; font-weight: 500; border-bottom: 2px solid #1A1918\">Architectural</a>\n        <a class=\"cap\" href=\"/quiklit/\" style=\"text-decoration: none; padding: 12px 0; color: #6B6660\">QuikLit</a>\n        <a class=\"cap\" href=\"/decorative/\" style=\"text-decoration: none; padding: 12px 0; color: #6B6660\">Decorative</a>\n      </nav>\n      <a class=\"cap\" href=\"/\" style=\"text-decoration: none; padding: 12px 0; color: #6B6660\">MIRAKLE home</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <header class=\"wrap\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 16px; padding-top: 22px; padding-bottom: 22px; border-bottom: 1px solid #DCD6CD\">\n    <div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 16px\">\n      <a href=\"/\" aria-label=\"MIRAKLE home\" style=\"display: flex\"><img src=\"/img/Mirakle_Logo_Black.svg\" alt=\"MIRAKLE\" style=\"height: 32px; width: auto; display: block\"></a>\n      <span class=\"cap\" style=\"color: #6B6660\">Architectural</span>\n    </div>\n    <nav aria-label=\"Architectural\" style=\"display: flex; gap: 28px; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center\">\n      <a class=\"cap\" href=\"/architectural/#range\" style=\"text-decoration: none\">Magnetic track</a>\n      <a class=\"cap\" href=\"/architectural/#spotlights\" style=\"text-decoration: none\">Spotlights</a>\n      <a class=\"cap\" href=\"/architectural/#range\" style=\"text-decoration: none\">Linear</a>\n      <a class=\"cap\" href=\"/architectural/#range\" style=\"text-decoration: none\">LED drivers</a>\n      <a class=\"cap\" href=\"#enquire\" style=\"text-decoration: none; background: #1A1918; color: #F6F4F0; padding: 12px 20px\">Spec support</a>\n    </nav>\n  </header>\n\n  <div class=\"wrap\" style=\"padding-top: 24px; font-size: 14px; color: #6B6660\">\n    <a href=\"/architectural/\" style=\"color: #6B6660\">Architectural</a> / <a href=\"/architectural/\" style=\"color: #6B6660\">COB spotlights</a> / Recessed · fixed / TITAN\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Hero -->\n  <section class=\"wrap\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 48px; padding-top: 32px; padding-bottom: 64px\">\n    <div style=\"flex: 1 1 560px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 4px\">\n      <div style=\"height: 460px; overflow: hidden; padding: 0; background: #DEDBD6\"><img class=\"ph\" src=\"/img/titan.jpg\" alt=\"TITAN recessed spotlight with a black trim\"></div>\n      <div style=\"height: 460px; overflow: hidden; padding: 20px; background: #FFFFFF\"><img src=\"/img/titan_drawing.jpg\" alt=\"TITAN 12 W and 16 W section drawings, dimensions in mm\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: contain; display: block\"></div>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"flex: 1 1 400px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 20px\">\n      <span class=\"cap\" style=\"color: #6B6660\">COB · Recessed · Fixed</span>\n      <h1 style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 56px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 300; letter-spacing: 0.03em\">TITAN</h1>\n      <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 300\">Controlled light. Quiet ceilings.</p>\n      <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.65; color: #6B6660\">A fixed recessed spotlight built around its optic. A honeycomb micro-lens sits deep in the reflector. For service, the housing twists out while the trim stays in the ceiling. Made to order and assembled in India.</p>\n      <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(120px, 1fr)); border-top: 1px solid #DCD6CD; border-bottom: 1px solid #DCD6CD\">\n        <div style=\"padding: 16px 12px 16px 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px\">IP20</span><span style=\"font-size: 12px; color: #6B6660\">Indoor</span></div>\n        <div style=\"padding: 16px 12px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px\">CRI 90+</span><span style=\"font-size: 12px; color: #6B6660\">Option 97+</span></div>\n        <div style=\"padding: 16px 12px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px\">5 years</span><span style=\"font-size: 12px; color: #6B6660\">Warranty</span></div>\n        <div style=\"padding: 16px 12px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px\">8 controls</span><span style=\"font-size: 12px; color: #6B6660\">Driver in the box</span></div>\n        <div style=\"padding: 16px 12px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px\">To order</span><span style=\"font-size: 12px; color: #6B6660\">Lead time confirmed with the order</span></div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display: flex; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap\">\n        <a href=\"#configure\" class=\"cap\" style=\"text-decoration: none; background: #1A1918; color: #F6F4F0; padding: 16px 22px\">Configure the fitting</a>\n        <a href=\"/downloads/\" class=\"cap\" style=\"text-decoration: none; border: 1px solid #1A1918; padding: 16px 22px\">Request datasheet</a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- Model table -->\n  <section class=\"wrap\" style=\"padding-bottom: 72px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 20px\">\n    <h2 class=\"cap\" style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500\">Two sizes. One optic.</h2>\n    <div style=\"overflow-x: auto\">\n      <table class=\"tbl\" style=\"min-width: 560px\">\n        <thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">By size</th><th scope=\"col\" style=\"color: #1A1918; font-weight: 500\">12 W</th><th scope=\"col\" style=\"color: #1A1918; font-weight: 500\">16 W</th></tr></thead>\n        <tbody>\n          <tr><th scope=\"row\">Cut-out</th><td>Ø60 mm</td><td>Ø70 mm</td></tr>\n          <tr><th scope=\"row\">Diameter × height</th><td>Ø67 × 77 mm</td><td>Ø78 × 87 mm</td></tr>\n          <tr><th scope=\"row\">Drive current</th><td>250 mA</td><td>350 mA</td></tr>\n          <tr><th scope=\"row\">LED flux, 4000K</th><td>1,032 lm</td><td>1,389 lm</td></tr>\n          <tr><th scope=\"row\">LED efficacy, 4000K</th><td>117 lm/W</td><td>109 lm/W</td></tr>\n          <tr><th scope=\"row\">UGR</th><td>&lt; 19</td><td>&lt; 21</td></tr>\n        </tbody>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n    <span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: #6B6660; line-height: 1.6\">LED flux and efficacy are Bridgelux values for the COB at the TITAN drive current, Tc 85 °C: about 5% lower at 3000K and about 10% lower with CRI 97+. Nominal values ±10%.</span>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- Configurator -->\n  <section id=\"configure\" style=\"background: #F6F4F0; border-top: 1px solid #DCD6CD; border-bottom: 1px solid #DCD6CD\">\n    <div class=\"wrap\" style=\"padding-top: 72px; padding-bottom: 80px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 32px\">\n      <div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px\">\n        <span class=\"cap\" style=\"color: #6B6660\">Configurator</span>\n        <h2 style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 40px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 300; letter-spacing: 0.03em\">One fitting and its LED driver, chosen step by step.</h2>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 32px\">\n        \n          <div role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Watts · cut-out\" style=\"flex: 1 1 200px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px\">\n            <span class=\"cap\" style=\"color: #6B6660\">Watts · cut-out</span>\n            \n              <button type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"true\" style=\"text-align: left; padding: 12px 14px; font: inherit; font-size: 14px; cursor: pointer; border: 1px solid #1A1918; background: #1A1918; color: #F6F4F0\">12 W · Ø60</button>\n            \n              <button type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\" style=\"text-align: left; padding: 12px 14px; font: inherit; font-size: 14px; cursor: pointer; border: 1px solid #DCD6CD; background: #F6F4F0; color: #1A1918\">16 W · Ø70</button>\n            \n          </div>\n        \n          <div role=\"group\" aria-label=\"CCT\" style=\"flex: 1 1 200px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px\">\n            <span class=\"cap\" style=\"color: #6B6660\">CCT</span>\n            \n              <button type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"true\" style=\"text-align: left; padding: 12px 14px; font: inherit; font-size: 14px; cursor: pointer; border: 1px solid #1A1918; background: #1A1918; color: #F6F4F0\">3000K</button>\n            \n              <button type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\" style=\"text-align: left; padding: 12px 14px; font: inherit; font-size: 14px; cursor: pointer; border: 1px solid #DCD6CD; background: #F6F4F0; color: #1A1918\">4000K</button>\n            \n              <button type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\" style=\"text-align: left; padding: 12px 14px; font: inherit; font-size: 14px; cursor: pointer; border: 1px solid #DCD6CD; background: #F6F4F0; color: #1A1918\">5000K</button>\n            \n              <button type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\" style=\"text-align: left; padding: 12px 14px; font: inherit; font-size: 14px; cursor: pointer; border: 1px solid #DCD6CD; background: #F6F4F0; color: #1A1918\">Tunable 2700–6500K</button>\n            \n              <button type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\" style=\"text-align: left; padding: 12px 14px; font: inherit; font-size: 14px; cursor: pointer; border: 1px solid #DCD6CD; background: #F6F4F0; color: #1A1918\">Dim-to-warm 1800–4000K</button>\n            \n          </div>\n        \n          <div role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Trim\" style=\"flex: 1 1 200px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px\">\n            <span class=\"cap\" style=\"color: #6B6660\">Trim</span>\n            \n              <button type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"true\" style=\"text-align: left; padding: 12px 14px; font: inherit; font-size: 14px; cursor: pointer; border: 1px solid #1A1918; background: #1A1918; color: #F6F4F0\">Matt black</button>\n            \n              <button type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\" style=\"text-align: left; padding: 12px 14px; font: inherit; font-size: 14px; cursor: pointer; border: 1px solid #DCD6CD; background: #F6F4F0; color: #1A1918\">Matt white</button>\n            \n          </div>\n        \n          <div role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Control\" style=\"flex: 1 1 200px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px\">\n            <span class=\"cap\" style=\"color: #6B6660\">Control</span>\n            \n              <button type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\" style=\"text-align: left; padding: 12px 14px; font: inherit; font-size: 14px; cursor: pointer; border: 1px solid #DCD6CD; background: #F6F4F0; color: #1A1918\">On/off</button>\n            \n              <button type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\" style=\"text-align: left; padding: 12px 14px; font: inherit; font-size: 14px; cursor: pointer; border: 1px solid #DCD6CD; background: #F6F4F0; color: #1A1918\">Phase-cut</button>\n            \n              <button type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"true\" style=\"text-align: left; padding: 12px 14px; font: inherit; font-size: 14px; cursor: pointer; border: 1px solid #1A1918; background: #1A1918; color: #F6F4F0\">DALI DT6</button>\n            \n              <button type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\" style=\"text-align: left; padding: 12px 14px; font: inherit; font-size: 14px; cursor: pointer; border: 1px solid #DCD6CD; background: #F6F4F0; color: #1A1918\">Bluetooth</button>\n            \n              <button type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\" style=\"text-align: left; padding: 12px 14px; font: inherit; font-size: 14px; cursor: pointer; border: 1px solid #DCD6CD; background: #F6F4F0; color: #1A1918\">Zigbee</button>\n            \n              <button type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\" style=\"text-align: left; padding: 12px 14px; font: inherit; font-size: 14px; cursor: pointer; border: 1px solid #DCD6CD; background: #F6F4F0; color: #1A1918\">Matter</button>\n            \n              <button type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\" style=\"text-align: left; padding: 12px 14px; font: inherit; font-size: 14px; cursor: pointer; border: 1px solid #DCD6CD; background: #F6F4F0; color: #1A1918\">Casambi</button>\n            \n          </div>\n        \n          <div role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Reflector\" style=\"flex: 1 1 200px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px\">\n            <span class=\"cap\" style=\"color: #6B6660\">Reflector</span>\n            \n              <button type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"true\" style=\"text-align: left; padding: 12px 14px; font: inherit; font-size: 14px; cursor: pointer; border: 1px solid #1A1918; background: #1A1918; color: #F6F4F0\">Matt black</button>\n            \n              <button type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\" style=\"text-align: left; padding: 12px 14px; font: inherit; font-size: 14px; cursor: pointer; border: 1px solid #DCD6CD; background: #F6F4F0; color: #1A1918\">Matt white</button>\n            \n          </div>\n        \n          <div role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Beam\" style=\"flex: 1 1 200px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px\">\n            <span class=\"cap\" style=\"color: #6B6660\">Beam</span>\n            \n              <button type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\" style=\"text-align: left; padding: 12px 14px; font: inherit; font-size: 14px; cursor: pointer; border: 1px solid #DCD6CD; background: #F6F4F0; color: #1A1918\">24°</button>\n            \n              <button type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"true\" style=\"text-align: left; padding: 12px 14px; font: inherit; font-size: 14px; cursor: pointer; border: 1px solid #1A1918; background: #1A1918; color: #F6F4F0\">36° · standard</button>\n            \n              <button type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\" style=\"text-align: left; padding: 12px 14px; font: inherit; font-size: 14px; cursor: pointer; border: 1px solid #DCD6CD; background: #F6F4F0; color: #1A1918\">60°</button>\n            \n          </div>\n        \n      </div>\n      <label style=\"display: flex; gap: 10px; align-items: center; font-size: 16px\"><input type=\"checkbox\"> CRI 97+</label>\n      <div style=\"background: #1A1918; color: #F6F4F0; padding: 28px 32px; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 20px; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between\">\n        <div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; min-width: 0\">\n          <span class=\"cap\" style=\"color: #A39D94\">Your configuration</span>\n          <span style=\"display: none\">TTN-12-IP20-REC-3K-BK-DT6-BK36D</span>\n          <span style=\"font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.4\">12 W · IP20 · recessed · 3000K · black trim · DALI DT6 · black reflector, 36° · CRI 90+</span>\n        </div>\n        <a href=\"#enquire\" class=\"cap\" style=\"text-decoration: none; background: #F6F4F0; color: #1A1918; padding: 16px 22px\">Send this configuration</a>\n      </div>\n      <span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: #6B6660\">Fixed whites take on/off, phase-cut, DALI DT6, Bluetooth, Zigbee, Matter or Casambi. Tunable white and dim-to-warm take DALI DT8, Bluetooth, Zigbee, Matter or Casambi. The configurator only offers valid pairs.</span>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- Shared spec -->\n  <section class=\"wrap\" style=\"padding-top: 72px; padding-bottom: 72px; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 48px\">\n    <div style=\"flex: 1 1 520px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 20px\">\n      <h2 class=\"cap\" style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500\">Common to both sizes</h2>\n      <table class=\"tbl\">\n        <tbody>\n          <tr><th scope=\"row\">LED</th><td>Bridgelux COB</td></tr>\n          <tr><th scope=\"row\">CCT</th><td>3000K · 4000K · 5000K · tunable 2700–6500K · dim-to-warm 1800–4000K</td></tr>\n          <tr><th scope=\"row\">Colour rendering</th><td>CRI 90+ · option CRI 97+</td></tr>\n          <tr><th scope=\"row\">Colour consistency</th><td>3 SDCM (3000K and 4000K)</td></tr>\n          <tr><th scope=\"row\">Beam</th><td>24° · 36° · 60° (36° standard) · honeycomb micro-lens</td></tr>\n          <tr><th scope=\"row\">Finish</th><td>Trim and reflector in matt black or matt white, powder coated</td></tr>\n          <tr><th scope=\"row\">Heat sink</th><td>Die-cast aluminium</td></tr>\n          <tr><th scope=\"row\">LED driver</th><td>Remote, constant current, 220–240 V AC, supplied in the box</td></tr>\n          <tr><th scope=\"row\">IP rating</th><td>IP20</td></tr>\n          <tr><th scope=\"row\">Origin</th><td>Assembled in India</td></tr>\n        </tbody>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"flex: 1 1 380px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px\">\n      <div style=\"height: 300px; overflow: hidden; padding: 16px; background: #FFFFFF\"><img src=\"/img/titan_polar.jpg\" alt=\"TITAN polar curves, 36° lens\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: contain; display: block\"></div>\n      <div id=\"beam3m\" style=\"height: 240px; background: #1A1918; color: #F6F4F0; position: relative; overflow: hidden\"></div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- Downloads + enquiry -->\n  <section id=\"downloads\" class=\"wrap\" style=\"padding-bottom: 96px; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 48px\">\n    <div style=\"flex: 1 1 380px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0\">\n      <h2 class=\"cap\" style=\"margin: 0 0 16px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500\">Downloads</h2>\n      <a href=\"/downloads/\" style=\"text-decoration: none; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; padding: 18px 0; border-top: 1px solid #DCD6CD\"><span>TITAN datasheet</span><span class=\"cap\" style=\"color: #6B6660\">On request</span></a>\n      <a href=\"/downloads/\" style=\"text-decoration: none; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; padding: 18px 0; border-top: 1px solid #DCD6CD\"><span>Installation sheet</span><span class=\"cap\" style=\"color: #6B6660\">On request</span></a>\n      <a href=\"#enquire\" style=\"text-decoration: none; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; padding: 18px 0; border-top: 1px solid #DCD6CD; border-bottom: 1px solid #DCD6CD\"><span>IES files</span><span class=\"cap\" style=\"color: #6B6660\">On request</span></a>\n    </div>\n    <div id=\"enquire\" style=\"flex: 1 1 420px; background: #EDE9E3; padding: 32px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px\">\n      <span class=\"cap\" style=\"color: #6B6660\">Architectural team</span>\n      <span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: 300\">Quote, samples or layout support for TITAN.</span>\n      <span style=\"font-size: 14px\">Architectural Desk · +91 92657 33457 · roopesh@hrishalightings.com</span>\n      <span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: #6B6660\">The form opens with your configuration already filled in.</span>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n</div>\n", "footer": true}